<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[Crankcase Start Exhaust (process 16) at National (DEFAULT) domain.

Process 16 is chained to start exhaust (process 2), so THC/CO/NOx start exhaust
(102/202/302) are selected as its parents. Runs hourID 7 (key="6"; keys are
hourID-1) on road types 1 (Off-Network, where start rates are written) and 4. No
input database: starts come from the default database (the DEFAULT-domain twin of
process-crankcase-start-single).]]></description>
